    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκῠκάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw into a ferment, confound utterly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					531
				</span></i>
			; <i>mix confusedly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ταὐτὸν ὑμᾶς τρύβλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					1108
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα ς</span>. <i>make</i>
			such <i>confusion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				669d
			</span></i>; <i>make a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυκεών</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				12
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be thrown into confusion</i>, Sabin. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.20.6
			</span></i>.</div>
